"""
## Purpose and audience
Pins the observable execution contract of the EdgeCase subsystem spec lane
(edge_case_44_system_spec.spl): every scenario asserts a concrete language/stdlib outcome the runner
must report green for this subsystem spec to carry evidence weight.
Audience: compiler and test-infrastructure engineers triaging the EdgeCase lane.
## Operator workflow
Run `bin/simple test test/system/edge_case/edge_case_44_system_spec.spl` and read the per-scenario verdicts in the
`Results:` summary; each scenario asserts one externally visible outcome.
## Compatibility and limitations
Covers interpreter-path semantics exercised by this lane; native codegen
and performance envelopes are out of scope.
# @manual: primary
REQ-SYS-EdgeCase-001
doc/01_research/local/EdgeCase_lane.md
doc/03_plan/sys_test/EdgeCase_lane.md
doc/04_architecture/EdgeCase_lane.md
doc/05_design/EdgeCase_lane.md
